					<![CDATA[
						 <div id="wiki-tabview-a7ea1d2f293afdf0faead2d31f0bebb1" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Dr Moned's little space in the wiki</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div style="text-align: center;"></div> <div class="anom-bar-container item-Moned clear-6 esoteric author vlam warning {$american}"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item">Item#:</span> <span class="number">Moned</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level">Level6</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category">Containment Class:</div> <div class="class-text">esoteric</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category">Secondary Class:</div> <div class="class-text">author</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category">Disruption Class:</div> <div class="class-text">vlam</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category">Risk Class:</div> <div class="class-text">warning</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <div class="danger-diamond"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/classification-committee-memo">link to memo</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/dr-moned-s-temporal-pocket-universe/ArchivistsTransparent" width="400px" alt="ArchivistsTransparent" class="image" /> <h2><span>I was told it was about time</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <h1><span>Me, Myself and I:</span></h1> <p>As an avid reader, I ran out of books one day and found SCP Canon tales! After reading tons of them, it got me inspired to create my own tales and contribute to this amazing story universe. I am a huge fan of tales and long SCP articles with narrative.</p> <p>I also seem to have a neverending stream of ideas but not the big brains to pull them off, this creates a problem where I cannot write fast enough. I really ought to look at doing collabs with people, if anyone wants to collab I am probably down for it depending on what it is on. Although you may have to pull me away from my own GoI that should, by the time you read this, have a few more tales (The first one is my first jamcon tale down below).</p> <p>I am almost always on IRC, they can't seem to get rid of me, feel free to give me a wave if you see me in there.</p> <p>No idea how I managed to get an author page to be honest, but hurrah! Feast your eyes upon my blessed <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">cursed</span> machinations.<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>(Nothing yet&#8230;)</p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <blockquote> <h2><span>The <strong>Mega Cool</strong> award</span></h2> <p>This was awarded for my <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-factory-is-hungry-for-more">Factory tale</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606032183" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span>, you should go read all their stuff!</p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what/Mega%20Cool%20Award" width="200px" alt="Mega%20Cool%20Award" class="image" /></div> </blockquote> <h2><span>Jamcon!</span></h2> <blockquote> <p>For the Jamcon 2020 competition, I made my first tale listed below. I have to thank everyone who helped me with this.</p> <p>Theme 2 - Delicious:</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-factory-is-hungry-for-more">The factory is hungry for more</a></li> </ul> </blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <blockquote> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Random ideas for no specific reason</span></p> </div> <ul> <li>Esoteric classes should be used alongside the normal primary classes to help develop an SCP. ACS calls them secondary classes for a reason. :D</li> <li>The Ethics Committee is secretly really powerful.</li> <li>Not enough temporal stuff on the site, Hammer has some great stuff though, big up Xyank.</li> <li>La Rue is amazing and you should go check it out!</li> <li>Donkman is great.</li> </ul> </blockquote> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&lt;&nbsp;Some&nbsp;very&nbsp;nice&nbsp;peeps&nbsp;&gt;-</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&lt;&nbsp;Thanks&nbsp;to&nbsp;you&nbsp;all!&nbsp;&gt;-</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: left;"> <blockquote> <ul> <li>SharpEmbrace is way too good at crit, secret butterfly member?</li> <li>BlueJones is too hard on themselves, their tales are great.</li> <li>Calibri_Bold makes some great icons, you should go check their art page.</li> <li>Cyvstvi is a great author, I need to be more like them.</li> <li>Hexick goes to such lengths to crit which is really nice!</li> <li>Gerrymanderbassist has some great works.</li> <li>Jak does very good crit. Go check out their stuff.</li> <li>Roscoe is very nice and loves hugs!</li> <li>DrFullham is great at Borderlands 3, as well as being a great critter ;p.</li> <li>Torcsandanters was amazing when I first joined, major shoutout there!</li> <li>MJL who helped me with grammar because my grammar leaves something to be desired.</li> <li>Hammer who is great with Temporal stuff and helped me with my initial SCP drafting</li> <li>Malyce who helped with my writing and guided me when I started</li> <li>Oh and Popsioak has a nice Pope demon hole :D</li> <li>All the critters who spent time helping comb through my drafts.</li> </ul> </blockquote> <p>Sorry if I didn't mention you, feel free to poke me and I shall add you to the list!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> ArchivistsTransparent<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> ArchivistsTransparent<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-moned" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5596963&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606032183" alt="Dr Moned" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5596963)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-moned" >Dr Moned</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-moned-s-temporal-pocket-universe">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-moned-s-temporal-pocket-universe</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> Mega Cool Award.png<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> Mega Cool Award.png<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606032183" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/calibri-s-mega-cool-art-page-it-s-mostly-just-icons-but-what</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-moned" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5596963&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606032183" alt="Dr Moned" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5596963)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-moned" >Dr Moned</a></span></p> 
