						 <p><strong>&quot;What medicines do not heal, the lance will. What the lance does not heal, <em>fire</em> will.&quot; -Hippocrates</strong></p> <p><strong>Name:</strong> Agatha E. █████<br /> Known by Alias &quot;Dr. Rights&quot;</p> <p><strong>Security Clearance Level:</strong> ██████████</p> <p><strong>Profession:</strong> SCP Researcher and Analyst.</p> <p><strong>Location:</strong> ████████,██</p> <p><strong>SCP Work:</strong><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-288">SCP-288</a> - The &quot;Stepford Marriage&quot; Rings<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-291">SCP-291</a> - The Disassembler/Reassembler<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-346">SCP-346</a> - &quot;Pterry&quot; the Pterodactyl<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-347">SCP-347</a> - The Invisible Woman<br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-366 - Carriage Grubs</span> <em>Documentation revised and supplemented by <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/crayne-author">Dr. D.H. Aeslinger Psy.D.</a></em><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-383">SCP-383</a> - The Variably Useful Flu<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-417">SCP-417</a> - The Plague Tree<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-457">SCP-457</a> - Burning Man<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-467">SCP-467</a> - Confessional Phone Booth<br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-540 - Carnivorous Blow-Up-Doll</span><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-542">SCP-542</a> - Herr Chirurg<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-545">SCP-545</a> - Liquid Life<br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-561">SCP-561</a> - A Passive Rip in Time<br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-715 - Clone Booth</span> <em>Documentation revised by <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/djkaktus">Director Karlyle Aktus</a></em><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-978">SCP-978</a> - Desire Camera</p> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/dr-rights-personnel-file/rightschart.jpg" width="700px" alt="rightschart.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <strong>Note</strong><br /> <em>This is not accurate. Despite what anybody says.</em><br /> -█████ <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> rightschart.jpg<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> rightschart.jpg<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agatharights" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=232934&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606032184" alt="agatharights" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=232934)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agatharights" >agatharights</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-rights-personnel-file">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-rights-personnel-file</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agatharights" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=232934&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606032184" alt="agatharights" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=232934)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agatharights" >agatharights</a></span></p> 
