&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;CLOSE&amp;nbsp;UNKNOWN&amp;nbsp;FILE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
