&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;Testimonials&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;GreenWolf&amp;gt; ty why&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;GreenWolf&amp;gt; whyyyyy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;tawny&amp;gt; ty why do you do these things to me&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;GreenWolf&amp;gt; TyGently: please do not tag me in your horrible furry abominations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;Conwell&amp;gt; TyGently: Why did you release this upon the world?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;GreenWolf&amp;gt; ty why would you say these things&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;GreenWolf&amp;gt; why would you say these terrible things with your hands&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;GreenWolf&amp;gt; why would you conjure up such horrible images within our brains&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;tawny&amp;gt; look on the bright side&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;tawny&amp;gt; at least you&#039;re not ty&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;ch00bakka&amp;gt; oh yeah&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;ch00bakka&amp;gt; you like hell&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;lt;ch00bakka&amp;gt; you like garbage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;ChaoSera&amp;gt; You seem to be fucking a lot of aliens, Ty&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;GreenWolf&amp;gt; I fully endorse Ty &amp;quot;Meme Kissinger&amp;quot; Gently&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;TyGently&amp;gt; when people look back on me I want them to be disappointed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

