				<title>Dr. Veritas&#039;s Personnel File</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/leveritas-personnel-file</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: url(http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-great-hippo/scp_trans.png) center no-repeat ; float: center; border: solid 2px #000000; padding: 1px 15px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;Personnel Record Access&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;Note that access to personnel files is restricted to clearance level 3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tabview-75a9ad2528ceacab857a82a7906be54b&quot; class=&quot;yui-navset&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;yui-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;selected&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Personnel File&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addendum A: SCPs catalogued&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addendum B: Other documentation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;yui-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;/&amp;gt; Welcome to the SCP Foundation personnel database. Please enter access credentials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;[PLEASE&amp;nbsp;INPUT&amp;nbsp;CREDENTIALS]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Username:&amp;nbsp;*******&amp;nbsp;Password:&amp;nbsp;*********&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identity confirmed. Welcome,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[ACCESSING FILE&amp;#8230;COMPLETE]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Name:&lt;/strong&gt; Lucius Elijah Veritas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Clearance:&lt;/strong&gt; 4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Current Assignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Director of Research (SCP-914).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position:&lt;/strong&gt; Head of Experimental Security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Former Position:&lt;/strong&gt; Humanoid Psychology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Current Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Site-19-23.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serial Number:&lt;/strong&gt; 3475-83537&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile:&lt;/strong&gt; Specialised in personnel/humanoid interaction and Experimental Security, Veritas&#039; primary position is the Director of Research overseeing and mandating testing on &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-914&quot;&gt;SCP-914&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While he started working with humanoid objects, the overseeing of tests involving SCP-914 has been his full-time job for several years. During these years, his management has been described from &#039;&#039;strict, but fair&#039;&#039; to &#039;&#039;despotic and dictatorial&#039;&#039;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While generally unsociable, it is no secret that he is close friends with &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/new-technical-issues&quot;&gt;Technical Researcher Rosen&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/dr-rogets-file&quot;&gt;Dr. Roget&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since testing with SCP-914 is considered to be a &#039;&#039;test of professional skill&#039;&#039; by a portion of new researchers, Dr. Veritas currently holds the record of &#039;&#039;termination of most personnel outside of O5 command&#039;&#039;, with 132.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FROM:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. Daniels, Junior Researcher, Site 19&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. Gears, [REDACTED]&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SUBJECT:&lt;/strong&gt; Testing with 914&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gears, can you get Veritas off my back? I promise to be careful this time, I even read and signed his stupid &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-914-experiment-log-guidelines&quot;&gt;security manual for 914&lt;/a&gt; three times!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;~ Junior Researcher Daniels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FROM:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. Gears, [REDACTED]&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. Daniels, Junior Researcher, Site 19&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;SUBJECT:&lt;/strong&gt; RE: Testing with 914&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dear Dr. Daniels,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;According to the testing logs from two weeks ago, you attempted to &#039;refine&#039; a flamethrower, which resulted in considerable damage to SCP-914&#039;s containment chamber and SCP-914 itself. The repairs are still being made at the time of writing. I was not present at the time of testing, but at least two researchers described the result as, and I quote: &#039;&#039;Something you would see in a Terminator movie&#039;&#039;. While I am not familiar with the particular film, Dr. Julie is still in therapy following the incident. I feel forced to side with Dr. Veritas on this one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;~ Dr. Gears.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
