					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <div style="background: url(http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-great-hippo/scp_trans.png) center no-repeat ; float: center; border: solid 2px #000000; padding: 1px 15px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h1><span>Personnel Record Access</span></h1> <hr /> <h3><span>Note that access to personnel files is restricted to clearance level 3.</span></h3> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tabview-eb50ec78d33775c89df242b4b3ecb0c4" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Personnel File</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Addendum A: SCPs catalogued</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Addendum B: Other documentation</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p>/&gt; Welcome to the SCP Foundation personnel database. Please enter access credentials.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">[PLEASE&nbsp;INPUT&nbsp;CREDENTIALS]</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Username:&nbsp;*******&nbsp;Password:&nbsp;*********</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Identity confirmed. Welcome,</p> <p><strong>[ACCESSING FILE&#8230;COMPLETE]</strong></p> <p><strong>Name:</strong> Lucius Elijah Veritas</p> <p><strong>Security Clearance:</strong> 4</p> <p><strong>Current Assignment:</strong> Director of Research (SCP-914).</p> <p><strong>Position:</strong> Head of Experimental Security.</p> <p><strong>Former Position:</strong> Humanoid Psychology.</p> <p><strong>Current Location:</strong> Site-19-23.</p> <p><strong>Serial Number:</strong> 3475-83537</p> <p><strong>Profile:</strong> Specialised in personnel/humanoid interaction and Experimental Security, Veritas' primary position is the Director of Research overseeing and mandating testing on <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-914">SCP-914</a>.</p> <p>While he started working with humanoid objects, the overseeing of tests involving SCP-914 has been his full-time job for several years. During these years, his management has been described from ''strict, but fair'' to ''despotic and dictatorial''.</p> <p>While generally unsociable, it is no secret that he is close friends with <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/new-technical-issues">Technical Researcher Rosen</a> and <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/dr-rogets-file">Dr. Roget</a>.</p> <p>Since testing with SCP-914 is considered to be a ''test of professional skill'' by a portion of new researchers, Dr. Veritas currently holds the record of ''termination of most personnel outside of O5 command'', with 132.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>FROM:</strong> Dr. Daniels, Junior Researcher, Site 19<br /> <strong>TO:</strong> Dr. Gears, [REDACTED]<br /> <strong>SUBJECT:</strong> Testing with 914</p> <p>Gears, can you get Veritas off my back? I promise to be careful this time, I even read and signed his stupid <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-914-experiment-log-guidelines">security manual for 914</a> three times!</p> <p>~ Junior Researcher Daniels.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>FROM:</strong> Dr. Gears, [REDACTED]<br /> <strong>TO:</strong> Dr. Daniels, Junior Researcher, Site 19<br /> <strong>SUBJECT:</strong> RE: Testing with 914</p> <p>Dear Dr. Daniels,</p> <p>According to the testing logs from two weeks ago, you attempted to 'refine' a flamethrower, which resulted in considerable damage to SCP-914's containment chamber and SCP-914 itself. The repairs are still being made at the time of writing. I was not present at the time of testing, but at least two researchers described the result as, and I quote: ''Something you would see in a Terminator movie''. While I am not familiar with the particular film, Dr. Julie is still in therapy following the incident. I feel forced to side with Dr. Veritas on this one.</p> <p>~ Dr. Gears.</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div class="infobox"></div> <div class="sortbar {$sortbar}"></div> <div class="collab-header" style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h2><span>Collaborations</span></h2> <hr /></div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/local--files/leveritas-author-page/3550%204.png" style="width:300px;" alt="3550%204.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-3550">SCP-3550 (Artwork by SourBacteria)</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/local--files/leveritas-author-page/SGd5ryV.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="SGd5ryV.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2861">SCP-2861 with Researcher Zyn Kiryu</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <blockquote> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/crosslinks-guide">Guide to Crosslinking</a> co-authored with <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/researcher-zyn-s-personnel-file">Researcher Zyn Kiryu</a> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zachary-maxwell" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2975899&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606032186" alt="Zachary Maxwell" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2975899)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zachary-maxwell" >Zachary Maxwell</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/an-exercise-in-narrative-based-scps/comments/show">An exercise in narrative based SCPs</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-914-experiment-log-guidelines/comments/show">SCP-914 Experiment Log Guidelines</a></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> SCP-3550 (Artwork by SourBacteria)<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> SCP-3550 (Artwork by SourBacteria)<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sourbacteria" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3038828&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606032186" alt="SourBacteria" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3038828)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sourbacteria" >SourBacteria</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/sourbacteria-s-art-gallery">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/sourbacteria-s-art-gallery</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> SCP-2861 with Researcher Zyn Kiryu<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> SCP-2861 with Researcher Zyn Kiryu<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1558990&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606032186" alt="Leveritas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1558990)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" >Leveritas</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/leveritas-personnel-file">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/leveritas-personnel-file</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1558990&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606032186" alt="Leveritas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1558990)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" >Leveritas</a></span></p> 
